1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:07,688
Next week, I'm in Mumbai for Devcon, IBW, and ETHGlobal. Hundreds of people, in seven days.

2
00:00:07,638 --> 00:00:09,350
And I know how it goes.

3
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:13,804
A week later, I've forgotten what we talked about, and what I promised them.

4
00:00:13,754 --> 00:00:15,725
So this time, I built Glance.

5
00:00:15,745 --> 00:00:18,399
To remember people, not just collect them.

6
00:00:18,349 --> 00:00:22,001
I meet someone, I scan their code, or just their badge.

7
00:00:22,021 --> 00:00:25,679
And Glance finds them on X, LinkedIn, and Telegram.

8
00:00:25,629 --> 00:00:27,679
Then I record a quick voice note.

9
00:00:27,699 --> 00:00:29,956
AI turns it into clean notes.

10
00:00:29,976 --> 00:00:31,882
Or I just type them myself.

11
00:00:31,832 --> 00:00:34,731
All their accounts come together, in one place.

12
00:00:34,751 --> 00:00:36,582
One person, every handle.

13
00:00:36,602 --> 00:00:39,137
And nothing links, until I say so.

14
00:00:39,087 --> 00:00:41,977
Every promise I make becomes a follow up.

15
00:00:41,997 --> 00:00:43,218
Ready to send.

16
00:00:43,887 --> 00:00:45,940
And all of it stays on my phone.

17
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:47,695
Not on anyone's server.

18
00:00:48,187 --> 00:00:52,151
Ever come home from a conference with a phone full of strangers?

19
00:00:52,171 --> 00:00:53,335
Yeah. Me too.

20
00:00:53,355 --> 00:00:56,193
So tell me, what should Glance remember next?
